     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi folks,<div><br></div><div>As usual, our weekly work session will be tomorrow in the DSI* space in the Shields Library, Room 360 from 10am-12pm.  Come by!</div><div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Our first open work session of the quarter will be this coming Tuesday, April 11, from <span>10am-12pm</span> in Shields 360.  Bring your R questions and projects, and we&#39;ll see you there!</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Adios,</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Ryan</div><div><h1><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><i>*Data Science Initiative - Directions</i></font></h1><i><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">On campus, we&#39;re in<span> </span><a href=\"http://campusmap.ucdavis.edu/?b=114\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://campusmap.ucdavis.edu/?b%3D114&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466944315000&amp;usg=AOvVaw174y7uXLBEEf7EBDxHqlZ5\">Shields Library</a><span> </span>Davis, CA</font></i><p></p><h1><i><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Within Shields Library</font></i></h1><ul><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><i><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Walk in the main entrance of the library, go up the first set of stairs.</font></i></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><i><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Go up the second set of stairs on the right side</font></i></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><i><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Go through the double doors at the top of the stairs and turn left.</font></i></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><i><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Walk all the way to the end of the corridor.</font></i></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><i><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">To the right of the exit sign is the door to room 362. Go around the corner to the door right next to the water fountain. You&#39;re there.</font></i></li></ul><i><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">The DSI is in the space previously occupied by the Institute of Governmental Affairs (IGA).</font></i></div></div><div><br></div><div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline\"><span> </span></span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></b></i></font></span><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><font size=\"1\"><i>&quot;When we try to pick out anything by itself, we find it hitched to everything else in the universe.&quot;<b><br>John Muir (My First Summer in the Sierra, 1911)</b></i></font></div><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b>-----------------------------------------------------</b></i></font></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;line-height:19px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><div>Ryan Peek</div><div>PhD Candidate, Graduate Group in Ecology<br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">Center for Watershed Sciences, UC Davis</div></font></span><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><div><b style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148);font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\"><i><a href=\"http://ryanpeek.github.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ryanpeek.github.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466944316000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1o2m79mw_JhC-1mFwHC1gG\">ryanpeek.github.io</a></i></b><br></div><div><b style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148);font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">@riverpeek</b></div></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20754-5351\" value=\"+15307545351\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">530.754.5351</a> </span><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,